{"id":"7dbf1cc768d38c8b","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-pr-closed-under-comp.md","title":"fact-pr-closed-under-comp — PR Closed Under Composition","display":"fact-pr-closed-under-comp — PR Closed Under Composition","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-pr-closed-under-comp","aliases":["92-fact-pr-closed-under-comp"],"display":"fact-pr-closed-under-comp — PR Closed Under Composition","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-composition]]"],"source":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义","source_status":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-pr-closed-under-comp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-pr-closed-under-comp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-pr-closed-under-comp — PR Closed Under Composition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_1,\\ldots,h_m:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h_1,\\ldots,h_m:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (function parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\\)</span> (typed composition operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}comp}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\bigr)\\;\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\bigr)^m\\;\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\\mathrm{PR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}comp}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\bigr)\\;\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\bigr)^m\\;\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\\mathrm{PR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原始递归函数在复合运算下封闭</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_i\">\\(h_i\\)</span>是PR，则复合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>也是PR</li>\n<li>证明：复合是PR定义的允许运算之一</li>\n<li>这保证了从PR函数构造更复杂函数时仍保持PR性质</li>\n<li>用于证明PR函数在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7d55d92fc12a07fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7d55d92fc12a07fc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (typed composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h_1,\\ldots,h_m:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}comp}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\bigr)\\;\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\bigr)^m\\;\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\\mathrm{PR}.","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"h_i","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1494,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-371","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-fact-pr-closed-under-comp]]"}],"outgoing":["8bff